### Minimum product acceptance

A verified therapist can be discovered and booked by an authenticated customer; payment and booking state are synchronized; the therapist can fulfill the appointment; the final amounts can be reconciled; both participants can report concerns; authorized staff can resolve a case; all sensitive actions are auditable; and customers can install the PWA on supported phones.

